Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.83,0:00:04.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,How do you feel about Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:10.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is gonna make me sound like an otaku,\Nbut he's kind of like Ashford-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.63,0:00:12.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that basically mean you're into him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.42,0:00:14.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:19.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,They went to that event together last weekend...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.38,0:00:23.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,If Ririsa has a thing for Senpai,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:25.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,that event would've been\Nthe perfect opportunity...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.17,0:00:28.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, I love you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.08,0:00:30.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.75,0:00:35.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, no way that'd happen. Not with Ririsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:37.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop worrying, Mikari!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.13,0:00:39.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa can try,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.25,0:00:41.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,but Senpai will see that\NI'm the better choice...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:48.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:52.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, guess who's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.04,0:02:33.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(448,403.2)}{\an7}Tips From a Master!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.79,0:02:35.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Darn, it's just Ririsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.96,0:02:38.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You seriously need to lock the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.21,0:02:39.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikari-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.25,0:02:41.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.38,0:02:43.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I washed the clothes you lent me, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.46,0:02:44.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Put some on, first!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.79,0:02:45.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:47.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,So how did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.83,0:02:50.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You better not have had any soft\Nmoments with Senpai at that event!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.75,0:02:54.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,We had a ton of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.63,0:03:00.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,After you asked me how I felt about him,\NI started thinking about it more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.83,0:03:09.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I realized that I do love him,\Nas a supportive photographer and a friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.33,0:03:13.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it now. She's an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:15.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, no changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.79,0:03:20.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank god both she and that\NLilliel lunatic are total morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.04,0:03:23.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That means I've still got a chance at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.04,0:03:27.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where's Senpai, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.58,0:03:30.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,The second-years had a test today,\Nso he'll be a little late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:35.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I figured I could use this time to\Nget changed for today's shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.17,0:03:36.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.92,0:03:41.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Class 1-1, Ririsa Amano!\NGet to your classroom immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.04,0:03:43.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I forgot about mandatory tutoring!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.67,0:03:46.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should stop sleeping through class.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.96,0:03:49.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikari-chan, m-my stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.21,0:03:50.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Will you watch my stuff?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.71,0:03:51.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:52.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.71,0:03:54.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't say I was gonna!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.54,0:04:03.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've got other stuff to do, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.38,0:04:09.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why is my classroom so far\Naway from the club building?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:14.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:18.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.71,0:04:21.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I-I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.42,0:04:25.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?\NYou shouldn't be running in the halls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.71,0:04:28.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Us girls have to be careful.\NWe don't want cuts or bruises ruining our good looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.63,0:04:31.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,R-right, I'll be more careful, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.54,0:04:36.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,T-that teacher was so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:45.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Ririsa, that took longer than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.50,0:04:48.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not what you think, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.04,0:04:55.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought if I dressed up as Lilliel\NI might be able to understand you a little better?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.38,0:05:02.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Or like, if I were Lilliel,\Nmaybe you'd like me a little bit more...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.67,0:05:06.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll take it off. I know it looks weird on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.96,0:05:12.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, it, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.75,0:05:14.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's working?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.13,0:05:16.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Guess he doesn't care who's wearing the costume!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.75,0:05:22.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, then that proves he's not into Ririsa,\Nhe's only into Lilliel...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.58,0:05:24.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, okay then!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.92,0:05:26.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:30.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ashford-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:39.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lilliel! All up on me! What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.08,0:05:41.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-it's too much to bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:42.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I'm losing my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.75,0:05:50.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ashford-sama, I'm feeling a little different today...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.04,0:05:56.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,So you can do whatever you want to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:05:58.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whatever I want?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:00.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.17,0:06:02.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Touch me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.04,0:06:05.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,wherever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.29,0:06:09.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Touch you wherever I want?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.58,0:06:11.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,What now, Senpai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.38,0:06:13.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can't say no to Lilliel, can you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.96,0:06:15.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.38,0:06:17.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.33,0:06:19.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:24.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lilliel might be my waifu,\Nbut she's other people's waifu, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.13,0:06:26.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be okay for me to cross that line with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.83,0:06:28.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Darn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.25,0:06:32.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.21,0:06:36.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stupid as that reaction was,\NI do like how he's such a gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:38.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:42.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wish he'd feel that way for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:47.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry I'm late! Let's get s...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.46,0:06:52.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-wait, Ririsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.42,0:06:54.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's not what you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.83,0:07:05.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing Lilliel in the flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.42,0:07:06.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're so cute and perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.67,0:07:08.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,D-don't make fun of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.46,0:07:10.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know this looks dumb on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:13.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I don't look like her at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.17,0:07:15.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,My chest's too small, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.33,0:07:16.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.63,0:07:17.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.38,0:07:23.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I did say you'd make a much better Miriella,\Nbut I don't think you make a bad Lilliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.83,0:07:25.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can cosplay whatever you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.79,0:07:29.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the great thing about cosplay:\Nanyone can be whatever character they want to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:31.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.33,0:07:33.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I totally agree, Mikari.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.13,0:07:36.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fan art isn't about being accurate or correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:37.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hell, 'bad' fan art is totally valid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.21,0:07:42.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's important is conveying\Nyour love and having it understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:44.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's what makes us happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:48.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa... Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.50,0:07:52.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You guys are way too naïve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:53.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,50.4)}{\an7}feeling guilty that she’s in\N{\pos(128,100.8)}{\an7}this for ulterior motives
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.21,0:07:57.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,So... What're you wearing under her skirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.42,0:08:00.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, those are intense panties!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.46,0:08:01.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,How are they intense?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:03.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let me get a better look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.13,0:08:04.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,No! Okay, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.46,0:08:07.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm never wearing this costume again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.88,0:08:13.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura, my lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.38,0:08:14.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ogino-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.79,0:08:19.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,T-thanks for having me today.\NAnd sorry to text you out of the blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.25,0:08:20.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,'Tis my pleasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.67,0:08:24.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to improve my skills before the next event.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.88,0:08:27.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I figured I could learn a few things from watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.88,0:08:28.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:33.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've come to me,\Nseeking a master from whom to train!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.71,0:08:39.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you perhaps sense my spirit has\Nbeen hardened by many a battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:42.04,Q3,,0,0,0,,Indeed, it has!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:42.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I asked 'cause he's the only one I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:43.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Better not tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.46,0:08:44.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right, then, let us be off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.00,0:08:48.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yes, thanks again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.29,0:08:51.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's so easy to forget he's a nice guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.38,0:08:56.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Her costume today is very Japanese,\Nso we've rented out a traditional tatami room!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.08,0:09:02.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,An environment perfectly suited for\Nthe character is pivotal for a good photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.25,0:09:03.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.67,0:09:07.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,And if you want to sell lots of copies,\Nyou must take photos in a proper studio!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.75,0:09:12.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,With the cosplay scene continuing to grow,\Nrentable studios are all the more common,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.54,0:09:15.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,and you can rent them for even cheaper on weekdays!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:19.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ogino, is my obi okay in the back?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.46,0:09:23.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,This costume is really high quality,\Nbut once it's on I can't reach around to the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:24.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,At once, milady!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.96,0:09:29.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's Lady Folosso's oiran outfit!\NThat design literally just came out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.75,0:09:34.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura-kun, right? Hey! Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.58,0:09:37.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks for letting me sit in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.13,0:09:38.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.42,0:09:40.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,A youngin' like you gets me inspired to work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.63,0:09:43.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you not a college student yourself, milady?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:46.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,L-let us begin, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.83,0:09:50.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,There are two fundamental basics to remember:\Ntiming and focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:56.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,No amount of editing can fix a photo\Nthat was poorly timed or is out of focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.58,0:10:00.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,My next tip is to carefully consider\Nthe theme of each photo you're taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.96,0:10:01.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:04.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,You aren't just capturing her expression or her posture.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:09.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Remain conscious of what you want to show the viewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.71,0:10:15.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our job is to know what the cosplayer wants\Nand how they will time their expressions,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.83,0:10:18.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,then capture both of those perfectly on film!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.42,0:10:20.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.25,0:10:21.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okey dokey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.00,0:10:28.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,First, keep your eye on our model,\Nand try to time your photo perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.33,0:10:29.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.63,0:10:38.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hmm... novice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.75,0:10:43.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't be annoyed!\NThis is why I asked him to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:46.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Compare your photo to mine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.08,0:10:47.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:51.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can you see how my shot was taken at\Na slightly different moment than yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.79,0:10:54.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,No two photographers are the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:56.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,A good photo is a collaborative effort!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.46,0:10:57.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,G-got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.04,0:11:01.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura, milord!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.79,0:11:04.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Focus now on Lady Magino's breathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.21,0:11:05.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.08,0:11:10.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then plan out how you will frame the shot!\NMake it feel alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.79,0:11:12.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lemme see!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.54,0:11:16.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, these are great!\NYou've totally got a knack for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.04,0:11:21.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-he learns fast!\NPerhaps because he had a most excellent teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.33,0:11:23.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,They look just like yours, Ogino!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.00,0:11:26.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Send this one to me,\NI wanna put it on my next cosrom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.29,0:11:27.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.25,0:11:29.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.83,0:11:32.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it okay if we start taking some sexier pics?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.63,0:11:37.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure, but... Are you okay with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.29,0:11:39.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Don't go getting a nosebleed on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.63,0:11:50.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whatever is the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.42,0:11:54.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-it just feels weird to be taking these kinds of pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.92,0:11:58.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like, I feel like if I were her, I wouldn't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.46,0:12:03.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,While I can understand where you're coming from...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.38,0:12:06.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do understand that cosplayers\Nenjoy when others look upon them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.63,0:12:11.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,We are here to help them achieve that.\NWhat we are doing isn't wrong in the slightest!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.83,0:12:15.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, Okumura-kun, do you have a crush on Lilliel-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.83,0:12:17.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can get why this would be weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.08,0:12:19.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.63,0:12:22.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think Ogino-san's got the right idea about all this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.79,0:12:25.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just don't get why I can't think like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:29.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then talk about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.33,0:12:33.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not okay to keep going if you're\Nkeeping all that bottled up inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.25,0:12:37.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,If something feels off,\Nthen open up about it and argue if you have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.21,0:12:39.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's how you strengthen\Nyour relationships with people!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.88,0:12:41.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,G-got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.79,0:12:45.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry for all this trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.00,0:12:47.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You literally only met me once, and now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.38,0:12:51.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, c'mon, Okumura-kun!\NWho cares if we've only met once?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.46,0:12:54.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,We tabled next to each other at an event!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:57.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That basically makes us friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:12:58.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.88,0:13:00.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-you're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.75,0:13:05.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course, my lord Okumura!\NI'm in your debt, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.50,0:13:11.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how exciting\Nit was to discover Lilliel-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.54,0:13:16.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Us photographers are always\Nwondering who will be next.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:18.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Next to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.08,0:13:20.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura, perhaps a lesson is in order?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.33,0:13:24.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,There are four women who stand\Natop all others in the cosplay world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.00,0:13:26.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,We call them the Four Heavenly Queens of Cosplay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.71,0:13:28.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Four Heavenly Queens of Cosplay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.71,0:13:34.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,The quiet, serious beauty who perfectly nails\Nthe height and weight of every character,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.54,0:13:35.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Erika Awayuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.54,0:13:42.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,The adorable cutie hired by big companies\Nto flaunt her perfect costumes and makeup,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.21,0:13:43.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.13,0:13:51.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,The tights-loving, fetish-feeding,\Nultra-viral star with a rabid following,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.46,0:13:53.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yoki Hoshizuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.13,0:14:00.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,And the legendary goddess with a perfect\Nbody and undying love for every character,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:01.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayura!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.17,0:14:05.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Together, they are the\NFour Heavenly Queens of Cosplay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.04,0:14:10.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,There are way more than just four\Nincredible cosplayers out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.75,0:14:14.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,but otaku love naming their "Three Musketeers"\Nor "Four Heavenly Lords," so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:18.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, but didn't Mayura retire?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.83,0:14:21.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,My, you're quite with the times, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.13,0:14:22.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:27.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,After last summer Comiket,\NMayura has not appeared at events
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.17,0:14:29.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,nor posted on social media.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.71,0:14:34.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,As such, everyone wants to\Nknow who will succeed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.71,0:14:36.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who will claim her crown?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.54,0:14:39.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,And lo, as we wondered just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.08,0:14:42.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your Lilliel came onto the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.29,0:14:45.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seeing her, I was reminded of the shock\NI felt seeing Mayura for the first time...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.13,0:14:48.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I tell you,\NI was not the only one who felt that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.25,0:14:50.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.88,0:14:52.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,So you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.13,0:14:56.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You see, I've invited you here today to assist our rival!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.25,0:15:00.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,T'would be less exciting if she was burdened\Nby an inexperienced photographer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.75,0:15:07.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I vow to take Lady Magino\Nto the top of the cosplay world!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:09.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you say to that, milord Okumura?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.13,0:15:17.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not that interested in being the best there is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.25,0:15:24.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, I'll admit... If you'll take me there,\NI'm happy to come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.42,0:15:31.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Photography is a collaborative effort.\NThey're doing this together...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:34.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura-senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.46,0:15:36.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Ririsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.42,0:15:42.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,People kept calling me her partner,\Nand I didn't really get what that meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.79,0:15:45.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought Ririsa was the only one who mattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.75,0:15:50.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I get it now. We do this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.67,0:15:54.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I promised I'd see things through to the finish line.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.33,0:15:59.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,So if that's what Ririsa wants,\NI'll take her there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.92,0:16:06.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa? Is that her real name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.08,0:16:10.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aww! It's like she was born to play Lilliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.17,0:16:14.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fear not. I will take that secret of hers to the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.75,0:16:18.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,In exchange, promise me you will\Nbring her to the next cosplay event!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.75,0:16:20.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,We hope to see you guys there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.42,0:16:21.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.04,0:16:33.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, today wer'e talking about the\NAquarium Club's request for promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.58,0:16:43.25,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(678.4,50.4)}{\an7}161th Student Council Meeting\N{\pos(652.8,100.8)}{\an7}Aquarium Club Promotion Request
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.38,0:16:38.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,They’ve got six members and\NKotobuki-sensei as their advisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.29,0:16:43.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,They’ve participated in a few contests,\Nand by all reports are doing quite well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.29,0:16:45.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,So they more than satisfy the\Nconditions for promotion to full club.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.92,0:16:48.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,All those in favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.00,0:16:49.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:51.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can I see a raise of hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.58,0:16:54.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, is it gonna be okay for them to\Nkeep live animals in the club building?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.67,0:16:57.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's a majority.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.25,0:17:00.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then we need to send a notice\Nto the club getting demoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.92,0:17:04.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, what are these?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:09.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I went shopping downtown this weekend.\NBehold, my hard-earned spoils.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.79,0:17:11.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can I look at them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.67,0:17:12.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.25,0:17:16.92,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(665.6,259.2)}{\an7}Lilliel
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.29,0:17:16.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, Senpai, these are intense...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.17,0:17:20.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I suppose they're valuable\Nreference materials for sexier poses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.42,0:17:22.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't even bat an eye, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.25,0:17:30.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that Lilimaru's newest doujin?!\NI love the way they draw Lilliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.13,0:17:32.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love the way they do her eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.33,0:17:46.42,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,165.6)}{\an7}Lilliel’s Your Present\N{\pos(588.8,230.4)}{\an7}Prison Lilliel
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.34,0:17:46.42,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(704,460.8)}{\an7}Lilliel Bondage
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.34,0:17:35.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You know, Senpai, are you more of a dom?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.54,0:17:36.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-what makes you say that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.71,0:17:38.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I never really thought about it before!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.58,0:17:41.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess Lilliel doujins do have a lot of that stuff in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.46,0:17:44.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I figured it's 'cause shonen manga girls\Nare always put into those kinds of situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.96,0:17:46.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Enough to change a man...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.46,0:17:48.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I totally get that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.00,0:17:50.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be for kids,\Nbut it's not all that innocent...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.38,0:17:57.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,But since I self-insert as the female characters,\NI guess that makes me more of a sub.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:17:59.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sounds like we're a perfect match!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.04,0:18:01.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,A perfect match?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.92,0:18:03.17,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(192,468)}{\an7}Ririsa\N{\pos(358.4,525.6)}{\an7}S-senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.92,0:18:03.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.46,0:18:05.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Get that stupid image out of your head, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.29,0:18:11.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y'know, it's even hotter when\Nshe's in even more trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:13.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You sure you're not more of a domme?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.17,0:18:18.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of girl characters who\Ncan get themselves out of trouble, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.00,0:18:20.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love them, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.25,0:18:23.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I'm all about Lilliel,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:28.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,so my favorite is when the\Nhero comes rushing in to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.50,0:18:35.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right, should we start taking pictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.08,0:18:37.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes! And I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.54,0:18:40.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's take pictures of Lilliel in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.50,0:18:46.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,L-Lord Ashford will come to rescue me, I know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.79,0:18:48.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's so into this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:53.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Carefully consider the theme of each photo you're taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.13,0:18:56.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Consider the theme... Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.25,0:18:58.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe focus on her bound arms?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.92,0:19:00.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,And get a shot looking down at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.54,0:19:02.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could you turn around and face me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.58,0:19:21.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai! Is it me, or did you get so much better at this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.50,0:19:22.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.58,0:19:25.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You got some lessons from Magino-san's photographer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.67,0:19:29.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we had a little training session, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.04,0:19:30.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry I didn't mention it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.29,0:19:33.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, you did this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:37.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ogino-san told me this isn't about us working separately.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.71,0:19:40.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,We have to work together as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.13,0:19:47.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you want to be cosplay famous,\Nthen I can't just be there for the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.08,0:19:49.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to put in the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.29,0:19:51.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that something you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.17,0:19:58.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I'm just happy showing\Neveryone how much I love Lilliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.88,0:20:04.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was never interested in getting famous,\Nor taking Mayura-sama's crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.13,0:20:07.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh. Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.71,0:20:08.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.17,0:20:14.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've been happy just enjoying, making,\Nand wearing my cosplays by myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.08,0:20:17.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,But going to that event with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.75,0:20:21.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,and having so many people\Nsee me in my Lilliel cosplay,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.25,0:20:24.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,made me start to want more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.08,0:20:30.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, it was so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.71,0:20:33.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wasn't it so much fun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.00,0:20:39.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I always wanted to go to cosplay events,\Nbut I had no idea they were gonna be that fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.71,0:20:46.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who knows how fun it'll feel to go to bigger events,\Nto be seen by even more people?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.21,0:20:47.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,To be seen by even bigger crowds?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.63,0:20:52.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,For them to know how much I love her...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.42,0:20:57.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Senpai. I'd be on board for that idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.46,0:21:02.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it really okay for me to ask you to help me get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.13,0:21:07.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I promised I'd help with everything, didn't I?\NBesides, I had fun, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.79,0:21:10.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's see just how far we can go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.08,0:21:11.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.75,0:21:15.08,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,266.4)}{\an7}Manga Club
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.75,0:21:15.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,The photo studio we were at was crazy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.67,0:21:17.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't think we can afford it just yet, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.96,0:21:21.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow! I've never been to one, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.29,0:21:25.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,We can manage with just our club room\Nif we make some backdrops and props.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.38,0:21:28.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I love our clubroom-
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.83,0:21:32.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Student council. Is the club president here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.13,0:21:34.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,The student council?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.38,0:21:35.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Unlock this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.29,0:21:40.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's against school policy to have\Nthe doors locked for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.46,0:21:41.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lilliel, hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.79,0:21:43.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.13,0:21:46.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.46,0:21:48.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.83,0:21:51.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nothing, just a message for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.50,0:21:55.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,As of today, the Aquarium Club\Nhas been promoted to full club status.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.13,0:21:56.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? The what club?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.92,0:22:01.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,As such, the Manga Club will be demoted\Nfrom full club to meeting group.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.21,0:22:03.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?! Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.46,0:22:04.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,According to our records,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.75,0:22:08.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,the Manga Club has not\Nqualified for full status for three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.50,0:22:12.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a problem before because\Nthere were open club rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.96,0:22:14.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,For three whole years?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.38,0:22:18.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the club president. How did you not know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.38,0:22:22.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,In any case,\Nwe're going to give this room to them instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.00,0:24:00.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(435.2,388.8)}{\an7}We Need an Advisor!
